# wear/woman/jerkin_sleeve_r: the shirt's sleeve under the jerkin over her right forearm: cloth1, a leather bracer at the wrist
# (A3's hunter read); the arm library's own shading kept, the hand bare
# One view per key of the woman's arm library (arms/adult/loco and arms/adult/pose woman_r / woman_l), on the same origin:
# a new arm key needs its view here too (the arm's forearm pixels recoloured in the sleeve's ramp, the hand left bare).
# GARB-W (P2b wave 2). Fitted to one body (STYLE_P2 22). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person woman
body woman
role garment jerkin
layer armNear
anchor shoulderR
keys armR
side R
z 1

